  "content": [
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "1. What is Urban Informatics?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Urban Informatics is an interdisciplinary field that applies:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Data science",
        "Information technology",
        "Urban planning principles"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "to analyze and improve urban systems and city operations."
    },
    {
      "type": "highlight",
      "text": "<span class=\"key-idea\">Key Idea:</span> Cities generate massive data. Urban Informatics converts that data into:",
      "list": [
        "Insights",
        "Predictions",
        "Actionable decisions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>👉 Objective:</strong> Improve efficiency, sustainability, and quality of life in cities."
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "2. Smart Cities"
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Definition:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A smart city uses digital technologies and data to optimize infrastructure, services, and governance."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Core Components:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Sensors (IoT devices)",
        "Communication networks",
        "Data analytics systems",
        "Citizen engagement platforms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Features of Smart Cities:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Intelligent traffic management",
        "Smart energy grids",
        "Waste management systems",
        "Real-time public services"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Example:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "<strong>Singapore:</strong> advanced transport analytics",
        "<strong>Barcelona:</strong> IoT-based waste systems"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "3. Urban Systems"
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Definition:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Urban systems are interconnected components that make a city function."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Major Urban Systems:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Transportation (roads, metro, buses)",
        "Utilities (water, electricity)",
        "Waste management",
        "Healthcare and emergency services",
        "Housing and land use"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "highlight",
      "text": "<span class=\"key-idea\">Key Concept:</span> Urban systems are interdependent:",
      "list": [
        "Traffic affects pollution",
        "Land use affects transportation demand",
        "Energy usage affects sustainability"
      ],
      "footer": "👉 Urban Informatics studies these interactions using data."
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "4. Data-Driven Governance"
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Definition:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Decision-making based on data analysis rather than intuition."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Traditional vs Data-Driven:"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Traditional Governance",
        "Data-Driven Governance"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Reactive decisions",
          "Predictive decisions"
        ],
        [
          "Limited data",
          "Real-time data"
        ],
        [
          "Manual processes",
          "Automated systems"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Applications:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Predict traffic congestion",
        "Monitor air quality",
        "Optimize emergency response"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Example:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "New York City uses data dashboards for city operations."
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "5. Digital Infrastructure"
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Definition:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The technological backbone that enables data collection, transmission, and processing."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Components:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Internet connectivity (fiber, 5G)",
        "Cloud computing platforms",
        "IoT devices (sensors, cameras)",
        "Data centers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Role:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Enables real-time monitoring",
        "Supports automation",
        "Connects different urban systems"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "👉 Without digital infrastructure, smart cities cannot function."
    },
    {
